# The lease data repo is a separate repository and must live outside this one.
# Cloning it in here makes git record a gitlink (mode 160000) that GitHub shows
# as an unusable grey folder and that Streamlit Cloud checks out as empty, so
# the lease files would never actually arrive.
msp-lease-data/
Leases and Templates/
